Package: dynoip
Version: 2.6.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.7)
Maintainer: NovaMind Labs <support@dyno-ip.com>
Homepage: https://dyno-ip.com
Description: Dyno-IP Dynamic DNS Update Client
 Automatically updates your Dyno-IP dynamic DNS record
 when your public IP address changes. Runs as a systemd
 timer (every 5 minutes) with security hardening.
 .
 After installation, edit /etc/dynoip/config with your
 update token from the Dyno-IP dashboard, then enable:
   sudo systemctl enable --now dynoip.timer
